# scenario 02.1: A correct skill is accepted
exec factory validate-skills skills
stdout '^validate-skills: ok 1 checked$'

# A skill with every allowed field and each form of the frontmatter subset.
# The field compatibility may name an agent tool.
exec factory validate-skills full
stdout '^validate-skills: ok 1 checked$'

-- skills/good-skill/SKILL.md --
---
name: good-skill
description: Does one thing. Use when testing.
---
-- full/full-skill/SKILL.md --
---
name: full-skill
description: |
  Uses every allowed field.
  Use when testing.
license: 'MIT'
compatibility: >
  Needs git. Tested with Claude Code
  and Codex.
allowed-tools: "Read Grep"
metadata:
  owner: engineer
  version: "1.0"
---
# Full skill

Read the design note first, then run the check.
